# ============================================================
# CLAUDE / AI LOCAL STATE
# ============================================================

# Local Claude/session artifacts
.claude/local/
.claude/*.local.*

# `SESSION_CHECKPOINT.md` used to be ignored here, as local session scratch. It is not
# scratch: it is the ledger of which claims about Somnia have been closed against a
# primary source and which are still assumptions, and the repo's own docs cite it by
# section (CLAUDE.md, SPIKE.md, STORAGE.md, Deploy.s.sol, ISomnia.sol all point at
# "SESSION_CHECKPOINT.md §n"). A citation to an untracked file is a citation to nothing.
# It now lives at docs/SESSION_CHECKPOINT.md and is tracked deliberately.


# ============================================================
# RUN ARTIFACTS
# ============================================================

logs/
*.log
cadence-state.json

# Temporary/runtime files
*.tmp
*.temp
.tmp/
temp/

# Scratch a session writes while verifying, and the screenshots the web smoke run
# drops. Both are regenerated on demand and neither is cited by anything, unlike
# SESSION_CHECKPOINT.md above.
.tmp-verify/
web/.shots/
tmp/


